{"id":"msg_m_ex_vesti_tactical_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_vesti","label":"Vesti · Nikke"},"label":"9. Commander,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_vesti_tactical_02","next":null,"speakers":{"vesti_t":"Vesti"},"icons":{"vesti_t":"si_c094_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_1","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_2","text":"do you like feminine girls? >.<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_3","text":"Yeah, I guess so.","jump":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_5"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_4","text":"No, not really.","jump":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_6"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_5","text":"I knew it! >.<","jump":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_9"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_6","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_7","text":"Oh, you don't?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_8","text":"Hehe, that's a relief.","jump":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_9"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_9","text":"What makes you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_10","text":"Oh, well, um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_11","text":"I was talking with Eunhwa today,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_12","text":"and we got on the topic of what kind of girls you might like.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_13","text":"Eunhwa was sure that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_14","text":"you prefer the feminine and graceful type.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_15","text":"I told her I didn't think so,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_16","text":"but she kept insisting that that's exactly your type.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_17","text":"I wanted to check for myself, so I decided to ask you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_18","text":"If you do like feminine girls, then well... I don't stand a chance :'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_19","text":"Why do you think that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_20","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_21","text":"Since I'm far from the feminine type.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_22","text":"Come on, Vesti, you're feminine enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_23","text":"Wha?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_24","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_25","text":">///<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_26","text":"What part of me makes you say that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_27","text":"Your clothing style.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_28","text":"Yeah? And what else?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_29","text":"You also write in your diary every day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_30","text":"Oh yeah, that's right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_31","text":"Plus, you have this cute little hobby of decorating your diary, too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_32","text":"Yeah, that's right! Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_33","text":"Wow, now that you mention it...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_34","text":"Thinking about how you've described me...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_35","text":"I guess I do have that side after all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_36","text":"It's kinda surprising, to be honest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_37","text":"I never really thought that part of me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_38","text":"could come across as feminine!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_39","text":"Hehe, somehow that actually makes me feel really happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_40","text":"I should write this down in my diary too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_41","text":">///<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_42","text":"Thanks, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_03_43","text":"I'll be in touch!","jump":null}],"chat":true}